DESCRIPTION:Pete and the Gang return for another incredible New Year’s E
 ve dance party\nDon’t miss this super fun dance party with a stellar ban
 d in Occidental. Come celebrate the new year with us!\nThe Gang:\nSunshine
  Becker (Phil Lesh\, Bob Weir)\nDanny Eisenberg (Phil Lesh & Friends)\nSea
 n Nelson (Phil Lesh & Friends)\nJustin Purtill (JGB)\nTickets are $40 adva
 nce\, $45 at the door.\nA limited number of VIP tickets are available for 
 $125 and include reserved\, raised seats\, invitation to sound check\, mee
 t and greet with the band\, champagne at midnight\, poster and snack bag.\
 nDoors open at 8:15 PM. Free parking. Refreshments available.\nNo outside 
 food/drinks inside the venue. No dogs at this event.\nPete Sawyer & The Le
 ft Hand Monkey Wrench Gang offer a high energy “all killer\, no filler
 ” Grateful Dead experience every time they take the stage. Featuring uni
 que combinations of many of the foremost interpreters of Grateful Dead mus
 ic\, Pete and The Gang have taken Northern California by storm since 2024 
 and they always deliver a well-curated exploration of the beloved Grateful
  Dead songbook!\nGet Tickets
